    <item>
      <title>美国FCC禁令阻断中资电信商接入美电话号码，联合国AI致命武器谈判无果延展两年</title>
      <link>https://111.230.153.15/news/?batch=smart-20261122-162600&amp;cat=tech&amp;event=evt_8d5834f5ed81</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">smart-20261122-162600:evt_8d5834f5ed81</guid>
